        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/aeb1de/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-02-28T11:53:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When making NPC heroes for your campaign, how many collections do you give them if any to represent previous heroic experiance? do you limit it to one? or do you vary it to show heroes of very different experiance levels?</p>\n<p>what would be your maximum collections you give them and why? how would you show and highlight a hero with decades of experiance against one of a year or two?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-03-01T13:02:36.881Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 26,
        "readers_count": 25,
        "score": 10.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 28203,
        "topic_slug": "collection-limits",
        "display_username": "deanjday",
        "primary_group_name": null,
